# Eval history files are append-only trend records (one row per suite run).
# The built-in "union" merge driver keeps both sides' appended lines instead
# of producing a conflict, so concurrent appends from different branches
# merge cleanly. See spx/13-infrastructure.enabler/25-eval-harness.enabler/
# ISSUES.md ("CI integration") for the staging-hygiene side of this.
**/evals/**/history.jsonl merge=union
